  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Realized integrated approach to decent work via social protection, just transitions, and supply chain development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will engage to support partners and constituents to adopt principles and approaches reflected in ILO social security standards in the transition from humanitarian to development-minded efforts with social protection. This will include support for the deployment of the joint-UN initiative on building capacity for social protection floors in the Arab region (TRANSFORM-Arab).</narrative>
  </description>
